 def git_env(**extra):
     """No inherited GIT_* variables and no user/system config, so neither
-    the audited repos nor the selftest fixtures can be redirected."""
+    the audited repos nor the selftest fixtures can be redirected. Every
+    git invocation also carries the global --no-lazy-fetch flag (git
+    >= 2.44), so repo-local promisor state cannot execute a lazy fetch
+    during the audit; a git too old for the flag is a typed refusal."""
